  "releaseNotes": "Add core contracts and file storage extensions:\n      - Introduce core abstraction interfaces for caching, databases, and file storage: ICache, IRemovableCache, IDatabase, INoSqlDatabase, ISqlDatabase, ISqlStreamingDatabase, ITransactionalDatabase, IFileStorage, IFileDeletable, IFileExistence, and IFileListing.\n      - Add FileStorageExtensions with helpers to read/write bytes, text and stream lines.",
